          "body": "According to custom instructions in 'Bundled skills': `glab stack save` now fails when run from an earlier or unrelated branch, but the bundled skill `internal/commands/skills/bundled/assets/glab-stack/SKILL.md` still says the opposite. Its \"save vs amend\" section says that if you run `save` from an earlier diff \"the CLI will warn you but still proceed\". An agent following that text now hits a hard error. The MR changes the user-visible contract of `save`, so the skill should be updated in this MR. It should say that `save` must run from the last diff and that `glab stack last` is the fix. The core workflow section may also need a note on this. Can you update `SKILL.md` here?",
